The compiled extension fast_mlsirm._core statically links third-party Rust
crates. Their license texts and notices that require reproduction are shipped
next to this file:

- NOTICE-libm-0.2.16-LICENSE.txt: libm 0.2.16 license (MIT, with Apache-2.0
  text and notice-preserving terms for code derived from musl and FreeBSD/Sun).
- NOTICE-libm-0.2.16-source-notices.txt: the Sun Microsystems, BSD-2-Clause
  and core-math (MIT) notices found in libm 0.2.16 source files.
- NOTICE-cfg_aliases-0.2.2-NOTICES.md: cfg_aliases 0.2.2 third-party MIT
  attribution notice for tectonic_cfg_support.

The full dependency list is in the CycloneDX SBOM under the wheel's
dist-info/sboms directory.
